{"id":"734a8eb1634c15b3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/08_second_order_semantics.md","title":"二阶语义：full、general 与理解闭包","display":"二阶语义：full、general 与理解闭包","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-两类绑定\">1. 两类绑定</h2>\n<p>个体变量是自然数，关系变量名字是“元数 n、序号 i”的有序对。关系应用的实参长度恰为 n，包括零元。个体量词只更新 ω→D 的赋值 e；关系量词只更新 ω² 上关系赋值 G 的一个键。两种绑定绝不使用同一栈。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"29a45fb50ac9d95e\" href=\"?note=29a45fb50ac9d95e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFm\">SFm</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34e58e195eb37fee\" href=\"?note=34e58e195eb37fee\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SRelDomains\">SRelDomains</a></td>\n<td><code>D, K</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b1eea2c458fe5be\" href=\"?note=3b1eea2c458fe5be\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFull\">SFull</a></td>\n<td><code>D, K</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d645c141ea336a\" href=\"?note=36d645c141ea336a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SModel\">SModel</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, D, I, J, K</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0813711a39c2290\" href=\"?note=a0813711a39c2290\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SAssign\">SAssign</a></td>\n<td><code>D, K, e, G</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"84b5c74b13d9fb18\" href=\"?note=84b5c74b13d9fb18\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STable\">STable</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, D, I, J, K, S</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ed1d89172a263c0a\" href=\"?note=ed1d89172a263c0a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSat\">SSat</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, D, I, J, K, e, G, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b6ad64bbe7cd6cc9\" href=\"?note=b6ad64bbe7cd6cc9\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSatFull\">SSatFull</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, D, I, J, K, e, G, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ef58afc7cc9bf1fb\" href=\"?note=ef58afc7cc9bf1fb\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SCompClosed\">SCompClosed</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, D, I, J, K</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"84b6038045461a48\" href=\"?note=84b6038045461a48\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSatComprehension\">SSatComprehension</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, D, I, J, K, e, G, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3c4fd3dee2f60a10\" href=\"?note=3c4fd3dee2f60a10\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqGeneral\">SConseqGeneral</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"29fca5c0e2809eac\" href=\"?note=29fca5c0e2809eac\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqFull\">SConseqFull</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"fdaac29642e66fd6\" href=\"?note=fdaac29642e66fd6\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqComprehension\">SConseqComprehension</a></td>\n<td><code>F, R, f, r, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><h2 id=\"2.-精确模型条件\">2. 精确模型条件</h2>\n<p>D 非空。K 的定义域为 ω，每个 K(n) 是 P(D^n) 的非空子集。General 只要求这一点；Full 强制等于整个幂集。SCompClosed 另要求任意公式、任意参数赋值、任意 n 个互异个体名所定义的 n 元关系属于 K(n)。没有把 General 与理解闭包混用为同一个定义。</p>\n<p>满足表 S 的行是 (公式,e,G)，对原子、否定、蕴含、个体全称、关系全称逐条给出等价条件。固定 D、K 后，所有合法 G 有集合界，例如由 ω² 与并集 K(n) 的乘积幂集界定，因此 S 不是跨所有模型的真类。</p>\n<p>表存在/唯一性由公式高度归纳的具体引理支持；量词处理全部固定关系域不是有限算法，但仍是一阶 ZFC 公式。没有有效枚举所有 full 结构的步骤。此处保留原稿语义逻辑，不另声称一个完整可递归枚举演算与 full 后承一致。缺少独立演算是范围边界，不能用单点语义证书掩盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-两类绑定","text":"1. 两类绑定","level":2},{"id":"2.-精确模型条件","text":"2. 精确模型条件","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFm","status":"resolved","id":"29a45fb50ac9d95e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFm|SFm]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SRelDomains","status":"resolved","id":"34e58e195eb37fee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SRelDomains|SRelDomains]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFull","status":"resolved","id":"3b1eea2c458fe5be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SFull|SFull]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SModel","status":"resolved","id":"36d645c141ea336a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SModel|SModel]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SAssign","status":"resolved","id":"a0813711a39c2290","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SAssign|SAssign]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STable","status":"resolved","id":"84b5c74b13d9fb18","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STable|STable]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSat","status":"resolved","id":"ed1d89172a263c0a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSat|SSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSatFull","status":"resolved","id":"b6ad64bbe7cd6cc9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSatFull|SSatFull]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SCompClosed","status":"resolved","id":"ef58afc7cc9bf1fb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SCompClosed|SCompClosed]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSatComprehension","status":"resolved","id":"84b6038045461a48","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SSatComprehension|SSatComprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqGeneral","status":"resolved","id":"3c4fd3dee2f60a10","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqGeneral|SConseqGeneral]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqFull","status":"resolved","id":"29fca5c0e2809eac","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqFull|SConseqFull]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqComprehension","status":"resolved","id":"fdaac29642e66fd6","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 两类绑定","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SConseqComprehension|SConseqComprehension]]","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":2443,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a802213915eee42","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[08_second_order_semantics]]"},{"id":"d1f11da81f471c54","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/08_second_order_semantics]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"},{"id":"4933e545c917088f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/08_second_order_semantics]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"}],"outgoing":["29a45fb50ac9d95e","34e58e195eb37fee","3b1eea2c458fe5be","36d645c141ea336a","a0813711a39c2290","84b5c74b13d9fb18","ed1d89172a263c0a","b6ad64bbe7cd6cc9","ef58afc7cc9bf1fb","84b6038045461a48","3c4fd3dee2f60a10","29fca5c0e2809eac","fdaac29642e66fd6"]}